<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" type="device"><diagram id="dp-background-overview" name="사용자가 계속 말하는 동안에도, VIA는 대화와 업무를 이어가야 합니다"><mxGraphModel dx="1920" dy="1080" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1920" pageHeight="1080" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="n1" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;rounded=0;fillColor=white;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.7;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="0" y="0" width="1920" height="1080" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n2" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;VIA 사용자 경험&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#5F6B77;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="28" width="1792" height="26.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;사용자가 계속 말하는 동안에도, VIA는 대화와 업무를 이어가야 합니다&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=40;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="68" width="1792" height="52.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n4" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3000000000000003;&quot;&gt;한 번의 이해로 끝나지 않습니다. 새 입력, 업무 알림, 과거 정보와 서로 다른 종료 시점이 겹칩니다.&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=26;fontColor=#5F6B77;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="126" width="1792" height="33.800000000000004" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n5" parent="1" edge="1" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#CDD6DE;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=none;endFill=0;"><mxGeometry as="g